The '''Chaos Druid Tower''' is located to the north of [[Ardougne]] and is home to 4 [[chaos druid]]s, located on the {{FloorNumber|uk=0}}. The [[Door (Chaos Druid Tower)|door]] is locked, requiring level 46 [[Thieving]] to open, and granting 37.5 [[experience]] when successful. Picking the lock does ''not'' require a [[lockpick]].

The tower also houses the entrance to a dungeon containing two [[Chest (Chaos Druid Tower)|chests]] requiring level 59 Thieving to open. Upon doing so the player receives two [[blood rune]]s and 500 [[coins]] and is granted 250 experience. Once a player has successfully opened the chest and removed its contents they will be teleported, along with their loot, to a house in the north of [[East Ardougne]]. The chest respawns every 210 seconds or 3 and a half minutes. The dungeon itself is also inhabited by 5 [[giant bat]]s and 7 [[ogre]]s.

==Transportation==
*Teleport to Ardougne with the [[Achievement diary cape]]
*Teleport to the [[Fishing Guild]] using a [[skills necklace]] or [[Fishing Guild Teleport]] (Level 85 [[Magic]] and [[Lunar Diplomacy]]) and run south-west.
*Teleport to the [[Outpost]] using a [[necklace of passage]] and run east.
*Teleport to the [[Ardougne farm]] patch using [[Ardougne cloak]] and run west.
*Teleport to Ardougne using the [[Ardougne Teleport]] spell or [[Ardougne teleport (tablet)|tablet]] and run north-west to the [[Chaos Druid Tower]], then go to its basement.
*Teleport to [[West Ardougne]] using [[West Ardougne Teleport]] spell or [[West ardougne teleport|tab]] and running east through the gate into East Ardougne and then north.

==Blood rune chest==
{{Main|Chest (Chaos Druid Tower)}}
Note that to open the chest safely, one must right-click and choose the "Search for traps" option. Simply left-clicking on the chest will trigger traps which can do up to 22 damage.
